# Retention

| Data | Retention | Owner |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Audit log | 365 days | Security |
| Customer exports | **Not decided** | Compliance |

Compliance has not confirmed the retention period for customer exports. Product has
proposed 30 days; Legal has asked for 90. Some exports are under legal hold and must not
be deleted; compliance will say how to identify them.

Deletion from the export store is permanent.
